--- OPERATION PRECEDENCE USING PARENTHESES
50 * 100 - 4999
50 * (100 - 4999)

--- NEGATIVE NUMBERS
--- 5 * -2 will raise an error
5 * (-2)

--- BOOLEAN ALGEBRA
True && False
True && True
False || True
not False
not (True && True)

--- EQUALITY
5 == 5
1 == 0
5 /= 5
5 /= 4
"hello" == "Hello"

--- INCOMPATIBLE TYPES
--- 5 + "llama"
--- 5 == True

--- PREFIX FUNCTIONS
succ 8
min 9 10
max 100 101

--- FUNCTION PRECEDENCE
succ 9 + max 5 4 + 1
(succ 9) + (max 5 4) + 1

--- FUNCTIONS WITH TWO PARAMETERS AS INFIX
div 92 10
92 `div` 10
